    <item>
      <title>Carb-loading, settled(ish): a 63-trial meta-analysis says eat 8+ grams per kilo for 36-48 hours before a marathon</title>
      <link>https://unbrokenreview.com/science/carbohydrate-loading-marathon-meta-analysis-glycogen/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://unbrokenreview.com/science/carbohydrate-loading-marathon-meta-analysis-glycogen/</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 08:00:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>Running</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://unbrokenreview.com/assets/photos/move-pasta-960.jpg" alt="Pasta, a carb-loading staple" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Quantity beat duration - loading past 48 hours added nothing; a hard session plus high-GI carbs can compress it to 24-36 hours. Caveat: only 12% of the 641 participants were women.</b></p>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://unbrokenreview.com/science/carbohydrate-loading-marathon-meta-analysis-glycogen/">Unbroken Review</a> &middot; <a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC13741990/">Journal article (SJMSS)</a></p>
<p>Feedback: <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/10%3A%20loved%20%22Carb-loading%2C%20settled%28ish%29%3A%20a%2063-trial...%22">Loved it</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/10%3A%20meh%20on%20%22Carb-loading%2C%20settled%28ish%29%3A%20a%2063-trial...%22">Meh</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/10%3A%20less%20like%20%22Carb-loading%2C%20settled%28ish%29%3A%20a%2063-trial...%22">Less of this</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=https%3A//unbrokenreview.com/science/carbohydrate-loading-marathon-meta-analysis-glycogen/%0A">Chat about it</a></p>]]></description>
      <media:content url="https://unbrokenreview.com/assets/photos/move-pasta-960.jpg" medium="image"/>
    </item>
